  /* the whole controller page: the tab bar, then one tab's cards.
     `extra` is the Sticks tab's own card R.aim adds (Speed). D248 (owner:
     "speed at the top, not collapsible, then deadzone below it, and then the
     curves"): Speed, Deadzones, Response Curve - under the Live Stick, which
     is always the top (owner, same evening). */
  /* D254: the ADS Response Curve card - the same Snappy / Linear / Precise /
